 "El nitrógeno entra y sale igual. Nos quedamos oxígeno y devolvemos CO₂ y vapor de agua.": "Nitrogen goes in and out the same. We keep oxygen and give back CO₂ and water vapour.",
 "La botella 3D gira despacio. La media se calcula sola con =PROMEDIO(B2:B4). Datos de ejemplo inventados; en adolescentes suele estar entre 2,5 y 4 litros.": "The 3D bottle turns slowly. The average is calculated automatically with =AVERAGE(B2:B4). Made-up sample data; in teenagers it's usually between 2.5 and 4 litres.",
 "Experimento: ¿cuánto aire te cabe?": "Experiment: how much air can you hold?",
